      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-950/90 border border-red-700/60 text-red-400 font-bold text-lg">🩸</span>
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold tracking-wide text-red-500 horror-glow leading-tight">
          THE RAKT PISHACHINI: RUKMINI KA SHRAP
        </h1>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400">Thakur Mansion • 10-Chapter Animated Horror Cutscene &amp; 4P Survival</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2">
      <button id="tab-story-btn" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-red-700 text-white border border-red-500 transition">
